# Wave W17-I (Mt. Millstone — Upper Halls): spray wall — pale spray bands in the cavewall idiom, one value up from the Lower Halls’ wet mill wall, its face mist-lightened where the falls’ spray hangs in the air and its hanging points drip shorter (design: the falls above the karate school run loud enough to argue with). The Upper Halls’ own wall.
